<title>USA: Hughes gets $102.7 mln US defense contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes gets $102.7 mln US defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Missile Systems Co, a unit of General Motors Corp, has received a $102.7 million modified U.S. defense contract for 1,299 &quot;Stinger&quot; anti-aircraft missiles for Taiwan, the Army said.</p>
</text>
